{"page":491,"width":1849,"height":2499,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"순차 탐색의 시간 복잡도","words":[{"text":"순차","x":404,"y":218,"width":77,"height":42},{"text":"탐색의","x":494,"y":219,"width":106,"height":42},{"text":"시간","x":614,"y":221,"width":73,"height":41},{"text":"복잡도","x":698,"y":219,"width":105,"height":42}]},{"text":"프로그램 13.1의 순차 탐색 알고리즘은 리스트의 처우부터 담색을 시작하여 해당 항목을 찾거나","words":[{"text":"프로그램","x":405,"y":292,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"13.1의","x":536,"y":293,"width":78,"height":33},{"text":"순차","x":627,"y":293,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"탐색","x":694,"y":292,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":762,"y":291,"width":142,"height":35},{"text":"리스트의","x":916,"y":290,"width":110,"height":35},{"text":"처우부터","x":1042,"y":290,"width":111,"height":35},{"text":"담색을","x":1169,"y":290,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"시작하여","x":1272,"y":289,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"해당","x":1405,"y":289,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"항목을","x":1477,"y":288,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"찾거나","x":1580,"y":289,"width":86,"height":36}]},{"text":"모든 항목을 검색할 때까지 항목의 기 값을 비교한다. 따라서 순차 담색 알고리즘의 복잡도는 두","words":[{"text":"모든","x":405,"y":350,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"항목을","x":476,"y":349,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"검색할","x":576,"y":349,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"때까지","x":672,"y":347,"width":79,"height":35},{"text":"항목의","x":764,"y":347,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"기","x":862,"y":347,"width":23,"height":35},{"text":"값을","x":899,"y":347,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"비교한다.","x":966,"y":346,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"따라서","x":1102,"y":347,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"순차","x":1201,"y":347,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"담색","x":1273,"y":347,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"알고리즘의","x":1345,"y":347,"width":149,"height":35},{"text":"복잡도는","x":1508,"y":347,"width":119,"height":33},{"text":"두","x":1637,"y":350,"width":29,"height":31}]},{"text":"가지 경우로 나누어 볼 수 있다. 탐색이 성공하는 경우에는 리스트에 있는 기의 위지에 따라 비","words":[{"text":"가지","x":406,"y":404,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"경우로","x":480,"y":405,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"나누어","x":577,"y":405,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"볼","x":674,"y":405,"width":28,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":713,"y":404,"width":29,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":754,"y":403,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"탐색이","x":831,"y":403,"width":82,"height":35},{"text":"성공하는","x":929,"y":403,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"경우에는","x":1056,"y":404,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"리스트에","x":1187,"y":405,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"있는","x":1319,"y":405,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"기의","x":1392,"y":405,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"위지에","x":1465,"y":404,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"따라","x":1567,"y":404,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"비","x":1639,"y":406,"width":23,"height":34}]},{"text":"교 횟수가 결정되는데. 모든 기가 탐색될 획률이 동일하다고 가정하면 평균 비교 횟수는 다음과","words":[{"text":"교","x":406,"y":465,"width":30,"height":24},{"text":"횟수가","x":449,"y":461,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"결정되는데.","x":550,"y":461,"width":146,"height":34},{"text":"모든","x":712,"y":462,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"기가","x":780,"y":460,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"탐색될","x":845,"y":461,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"획률이","x":942,"y":461,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"동일하다고","x":1039,"y":462,"width":148,"height":34},{"text":"가정하면","x":1200,"y":463,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"평균","x":1332,"y":463,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"비교","x":1405,"y":463,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"횟수는","x":1477,"y":463,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"다음과","x":1579,"y":461,"width":87,"height":36}]},{"text":"같다.","words":[{"text":"같다.","x":407,"y":518,"width":66,"height":33}]},{"text":"따라서 순차 탐색은 탐색에 성공할 경우 평균 (n+1)/2번 叩고하고 탐색이 실패한 경우 n번","words":[{"text":"따라서","x":445,"y":747,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"순차","x":544,"y":748,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"탐색은","x":613,"y":749,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"탐색에","x":709,"y":748,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"성공할","x":806,"y":747,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"경우","x":903,"y":748,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"평균","x":971,"y":749,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"(n+1)/2번","x":1039,"y":748,"width":158,"height":38},{"text":"叩고하고","x":1211,"y":753,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"탐색이","x":1342,"y":753,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"실패한","x":1445,"y":751,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"경우","x":1548,"y":750,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"n번","x":1618,"y":750,"width":46,"height":32}]},{"text":"비교하므로 순차 탐색의 시간 복잡도는 O(n)이 된다.","words":[{"text":"비교하므로","x":413,"y":803,"width":146,"height":34},{"text":"순차","x":568,"y":805,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"탐색의","x":635,"y":805,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"시간","x":731,"y":805,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"복잡도는","x":795,"y":805,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"O(n)이","x":919,"y":804,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"된다.","x":1025,"y":807,"width":64,"height":33}]},{"text":"13.3 정렬된 배열에서의 탐색","words":[{"text":"13.3","x":414,"y":1059,"width":80,"height":48},{"text":"정렬된","x":508,"y":1058,"width":134,"height":51},{"text":"배열에서의","x":661,"y":1058,"width":219,"height":52},{"text":"탐색","x":899,"y":1058,"width":85,"height":52}]},{"text":"정렬되어 있지 않은 배열의 순자 탐색은 이해하고 구현하기는 쉽다. 만약 배열의 항목이 일마 되","words":[{"text":"정렬되어","x":413,"y":1200,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"있지","x":542,"y":1201,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"않은","x":608,"y":1201,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"배열의","x":676,"y":1202,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"순자","x":769,"y":1202,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"탐색은","x":836,"y":1202,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"이해하고","x":933,"y":1202,"width":113,"height":32},{"text":"구현하기는","x":1056,"y":1204,"width":146,"height":33},{"text":"쉽다.","x":1213,"y":1205,"width":65,"height":32},{"text":"만약","x":1294,"y":1205,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"배열의","x":1366,"y":1205,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"항목이","x":1467,"y":1204,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"일마","x":1571,"y":1203,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"되","x":1639,"y":1203,"width":25,"height":32}]},{"text":"지 않는 경우에는 충분히 기능한 알고리즘이다. 그러나 배열이 많은 항목을 가지는 경우에는 순","words":[{"text":"지","x":413,"y":1255,"width":26,"height":32},{"text":"않는","x":454,"y":1256,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"경우에는","x":525,"y":1256,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"충분히","x":649,"y":1256,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"기능한","x":745,"y":1256,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"알고리즘이다.","x":842,"y":1257,"width":175,"height":32},{"text":"그러나","x":1032,"y":1259,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"배열이","x":1132,"y":1259,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"많은","x":1230,"y":1259,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"항목을","x":1301,"y":1260,"width":92,"height":32},{"text":"가지는","x":1405,"y":1260,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"경우에는","x":1509,"y":1259,"width":118,"height":32},{"text":"순","x":1637,"y":1258,"width":29,"height":31}]},{"text":"자 탐색은 너무나 비효율적인 방법이다. 예를 들어 10개중의 하니를 찾는 것은 순차 탐색으로 가","words":[{"text":"자","x":412,"y":1310,"width":31,"height":32},{"text":"탐색은","x":453,"y":1311,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"너무나","x":552,"y":1312,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"비효율적인","x":649,"y":1312,"width":139,"height":32},{"text":"방법이다.","x":799,"y":1312,"width":118,"height":32},{"text":"예를","x":933,"y":1313,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"들어","x":998,"y":1313,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"10개중의","x":1067,"y":1314,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"하니를","x":1195,"y":1315,"width":88,"height":31},{"text":"찾는","x":1294,"y":1315,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"것은","x":1367,"y":1315,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"순차","x":1436,"y":1314,"width":62,"height":31},{"text":"탐색으로","x":1508,"y":1314,"width":119,"height":31},{"text":"가","x":1638,"y":1313,"width":29,"height":31}]},{"text":"능하지만 100000071 정도라면 상당한 시간이 소요된다. 만약 10억 개 중에서 하니를 찾는 문제","words":[{"text":"능하지만","x":412,"y":1365,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"100000071","x":543,"y":1367,"width":140,"height":32},{"text":"정도라면","x":697,"y":1367,"width":110,"height":32},{"text":"상당한","x":818,"y":1367,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"시간이","x":915,"y":1367,"width":81,"height":33},{"text":"소요된다.","x":1011,"y":1369,"width":122,"height":33},{"text":"만약","x":1149,"y":1369,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"10억","x":1219,"y":1369,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"개","x":1291,"y":1369,"width":26,"height":32},{"text":"중에서","x":1332,"y":1369,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"하니를","x":1434,"y":1369,"width":92,"height":32},{"text":"찾는","x":1537,"y":1368,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"문제","x":1608,"y":1368,"width":56,"height":31}]},{"text":"라면 순차 탐색하는 것은 상당히 비효율적이다. 따라서 보다 빠른 방법이 요구된다. 아주 효율적","words":[{"text":"라면","x":414,"y":1420,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"순차","x":484,"y":1421,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"탐색하는","x":552,"y":1423,"width":116,"height":31},{"text":"것은","x":679,"y":1423,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"상당히","x":743,"y":1422,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"비효율적이다.","x":840,"y":1422,"width":174,"height":33},{"text":"따라서","x":1029,"y":1424,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"보다","x":1126,"y":1425,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"빠른","x":1195,"y":1425,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"방법이","x":1265,"y":1424,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"요구된다.","x":1365,"y":1424,"width":127,"height":32},{"text":"아주","x":1508,"y":1424,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"효율적","x":1579,"y":1423,"width":84,"height":31}]},{"text":"인 탐색 알고리즘인 이진 탐색을 살펴보자.","words":[{"text":"인","x":416,"y":1475,"width":27,"height":31},{"text":"탐색","x":454,"y":1476,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"알고리즘인","x":524,"y":1476,"width":142,"height":33},{"text":"이진","x":677,"y":1478,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"탐색을","x":742,"y":1477,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"살펴보자.","x":836,"y":1478,"width":119,"height":32}]},{"text":"정릴된 배열에서의 이진 탐색","words":[{"text":"정릴된","x":415,"y":1623,"width":110,"height":39},{"text":"배열에서의","x":541,"y":1624,"width":175,"height":40},{"text":"이진","x":732,"y":1625,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"탐색","x":815,"y":1624,"width":65,"height":40}]},{"text":"정렬된 배열의 탐색에는 이진 탐색(bmary search)이 가장 적합하다. 이진 담색은 배열의 중앙에","words":[{"text":"정렬된","x":416,"y":1694,"width":88,"height":31},{"text":"배열의","x":516,"y":1695,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"탐색에는","x":612,"y":1695,"width":113,"height":32},{"text":"이진","x":736,"y":1695,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"탐색(bmary","x":800,"y":1694,"width":152,"height":34},{"text":"search)이","x":961,"y":1696,"width":125,"height":32},{"text":"가장","x":1101,"y":1697,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"적합하다.","x":1170,"y":1697,"width":122,"height":32},{"text":"이진","x":1308,"y":1696,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"담색은","x":1377,"y":1696,"width":91,"height":32},{"text":"배열의","x":1479,"y":1697,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"중앙에","x":1578,"y":1696,"width":86,"height":32}]},{"text":"있는 값을 조사하여 찾고자 하는 항목이 왼쪽 또는 오른쪽 부골 배열에 있는지를 알아내어 탐색","words":[{"text":"있는","x":417,"y":1748,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"값을","x":488,"y":1749,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"조사하여","x":557,"y":1750,"width":112,"height":32},{"text":"찾고자","x":683,"y":1749,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"하는","x":778,"y":1749,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"항목이","x":844,"y":1749,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"왼쪽","x":939,"y":1749,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"또는","x":1006,"y":1752,"width":58,"height":28},{"text":"오른쪽","x":1075,"y":1753,"width":88,"height":29},{"text":"부골","x":1174,"y":1752,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"배열에","x":1245,"y":1750,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"있는지를","x":1347,"y":1751,"width":118,"height":31},{"text":"알아내어","x":1477,"y":1751,"width":116,"height":32},{"text":"탐색","x":1608,"y":1750,"width":56,"height":31}]},{"text":"의 범위를 반으로 줄인다. 이러한 방법에 의해 매 단계에서 검색해야 할 리스트의 크기를 반으로","words":[{"text":"의","x":416,"y":1803,"width":26,"height":31},{"text":"범위를","x":458,"y":1803,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"반으로","x":557,"y":1804,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"줄인다.","x":653,"y":1804,"width":91,"height":31},{"text":"이러한","x":759,"y":1804,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"방법에","x":852,"y":1803,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"의해","x":947,"y":1803,"width":52,"height":33},{"text":"매","x":1013,"y":1804,"width":25,"height":32},{"text":"단계에서","x":1051,"y":1804,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"검색해야","x":1179,"y":1804,"width":116,"height":32},{"text":"할","x":1305,"y":1804,"width":31,"height":31},{"text":"리스트의","x":1348,"y":1805,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"크기를","x":1477,"y":1806,"width":91,"height":31},{"text":"반으로","x":1579,"y":1805,"width":87,"height":30}]},{"text":"줄인다. 10억 명이 정렬된 배열에서 이진 탐색을 이용하여 특정한 이름을 찾는다면 위해서는 단","words":[{"text":"줄인다.","x":415,"y":1857,"width":98,"height":32},{"text":"10억","x":530,"y":1858,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"명이","x":600,"y":1858,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"정렬된","x":669,"y":1858,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"배열에서","x":764,"y":1858,"width":107,"height":32},{"text":"이진","x":886,"y":1858,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"탐색을","x":952,"y":1858,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"이용하여","x":1049,"y":1858,"width":110,"height":32},{"text":"특정한","x":1174,"y":1858,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"이름을","x":1274,"y":1858,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"찾는다면","x":1374,"y":1859,"width":119,"height":32},{"text":"위해서는","x":1508,"y":1860,"width":118,"height":31},{"text":"단","x":1638,"y":1858,"width":29,"height":30}]},{"text":"지 30번의 비교만으로 검색이 완료된다. 반면에 순차 탐색에서는 평균 5억 번의 비교가 있어야","words":[{"text":"지","x":418,"y":1911,"width":25,"height":31},{"text":"30번의","x":460,"y":1912,"width":91,"height":32},{"text":"비교만으로","x":567,"y":1912,"width":142,"height":32},{"text":"검색이","x":723,"y":1912,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"완료된다.","x":816,"y":1912,"width":117,"height":31},{"text":"반면에","x":950,"y":1912,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"순차","x":1045,"y":1913,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"탐색에서는","x":1115,"y":1912,"width":145,"height":32},{"text":"평균","x":1273,"y":1912,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"5억","x":1344,"y":1913,"width":42,"height":31},{"text":"번의","x":1404,"y":1913,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"비교가","x":1477,"y":1914,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"있어야","x":1580,"y":1912,"width":87,"height":33}]},{"text":"됨을 유의하라.","words":[{"text":"됨을","x":418,"y":1964,"width":60,"height":31},{"text":"유의하라.","x":488,"y":1966,"width":125,"height":32}]},{"text":"500 C언어로 쉽게 물어쓴 자료구조","words":[{"text":"500","x":145,"y":2358,"width":57,"height":28},{"text":"C언어로","x":230,"y":2357,"width":84,"height":24},{"text":"쉽게","x":323,"y":2357,"width":43,"height":24},{"text":"물어쓴","x":376,"y":2358,"width":68,"height":23},{"text":"자료구조","x":452,"y":2358,"width":89,"height":23}]}]}